                            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                                <div class="col-lg-7 pt-5">
                                    <h1 class="display-4 text-white mb-3 animated slideInDown">Association of Tamil Canadian Community</h1>
                                    <p class="fs-5 text-white-50 mb-5 animated slideInDown">Welcome to the Association of Tamil Community in Canada ATCC, your home for all things related to Tamil culture and community. We are a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting the interests of Tamil people living in Canada and fostering a sense of unity and belonging within the community.</p>
                                    <a class="btn btn-primary py-2 px-3 animated slideInDown" href="">
                                        VOLUNTEER WITH US
